        },
        {
          "text": "Bazalwane, madodana ohlanga lukaAbrahama, lalabo phakathi kwenu abesaba uNkulunkulu, lithunyelwe kithi ilizwi lokusiliswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
