          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba labo abahlala eJerusalema lababusi babo kabamazanga yena, futhi kabaqedisisanga amazwi abaprofethi afundwayo amaSabatha wonke, kanti bawagcwalisa ngokumlahla; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.27",
