          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NgeSabatha elilandelayo babuthana, kwaphose kwaba ngumuzi wonke ukuzwa ilizwi likaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abaJuda bebona ixuku bagcwala umona, baphikisa lokho okwakhulunywa nguPawuli bemhlambaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwang’khona uPawuli loBarnabasi bekhuluma ngesibindi besithi: Kwakudingeka ukuthi ilizwi likaNkulunkulu litshunyayelwe kini kuqala; kodwa njengoba lilala, lizenza libe ngabangafanele ukuphila okungapheliyo, khangelani, sesisiya kwabezizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
